jei.immersivenuclear.chemical_processor.info=3x6x3 multiblock (45 blocks). Build the structure and hit the redstone engineering block (front side) with the Engineer's Hammer. Inputs: water on the right (the same port takes chemical or depleted effluent into its own tank, up to half of each batch, saving up to a quarter of the reagent; the Industrial Dryer's process condensate goes into the same tank, only instead of water); uranium powder and reagent at the back; energy on the heavy engineering blocks. Slurry comes out on the left. A redstone signal stops the machine (the hammer inverts that).
