jei.immersivenuclear.electrode.info=Electrode plate of the Metal Extractor: it needs six, one per plate slot (they can be mixed). Steel is the base; the lead-silver anode alloy (as real cells use) gives more deposit with less energy and lasts twice as long; the electrum coating (standing in for the noble metal oxide anodes) gives the most and lasts the longest. Every batch wears each plate; a worn-through plate breaks.
