jei.immersivenuclear.quicklime.info=Burnt from diorite in the IE Coke Oven. Neutralizes the chemical effluent in the IE Mixer (it becomes neutralized sludge) and goes into the Precipitating Agent.
jei.immersivenuclear.neutralized_sludge.info=Chemical effluent (or depleted effluent) neutralized with quicklime in the IE Mixer. The Filtration Unit filters it like the slurry: 1000 mB gives a neutralization cake and 800 mB of plain water.
jei.immersivenuclear.neutralization_cake.info=Solid left when the Filtration Unit filters the neutralized sludge. 4 cakes make 1 Impure Agglomerate; in the IE Mixer it takes the clay's place in concrete.
jei.immersivenuclear.impure_agglomerate.info=The raw block made of neutralization cake or neutralized mineral residue (4 of either). Fire it in a furnace into the Agglomerate Block, the finished one.
jei.immersivenuclear.precision_engineering.info=Shafts, bearings and fine mechanisms: the casing of the enrichment and fuel lines' machines. Steel ingots, precision bearings, steel rods and electrum, like IE's engineering blocks (2 per craft).
jei.immersivenuclear.nuclear_engineering.info=Reinforced structure and couplings of the reactor systems: steel ingots, lead plates, IE's leaded concrete and a heavy engineering block (2 per craft).
jei.immersivenuclear.control_engineering.info=Relays and signal modules for the machines' control and automation: steel ingots, relay modules, electron tubes and an electronic module (2 per craft).
jei.immersivenuclear.radioactive_handling.info=The wall of a hot cell, for handling radioactive materials: lead plates for shielding, lead glass for the window, remote manipulators and a heavy engineering block (2 per craft). Goes into the Concentrate Drum.
jei.immersivenuclear.chemical_engineering.info=Steel plate lined against acid, the casing of the machines that handle sulfuric and hydrofluoric acid: steel ingots, IE fluid pipes, lead plates for the acid-proof lining (as real sulfuric acid plants use) and a light engineering block (2 per recipe).
jei.immersivenuclear.computer_part.info=Part of the mod's computers, which are in development: no recipe and no use yet. Get it from the creative tab.
jei.immersivenuclear.precipitating_agent.info=Goes into the Precipitation Unit, 6 per batch, to turn the uranium into a solid.
jei.immersivenuclear.wet_uranium_concentrate.info=Comes out of the Precipitation Unit and goes to the Industrial Dryer.
jei.immersivenuclear.yellowcake.info=Final product of line 1: uranium concentrate, not enriched. Comes out of the Industrial Dryer and is stored and shipped in the Concentrate Drum.
jei.immersivenuclear.process_condensate.info=Water condensed from the vapour of the Industrial Dryer, with traces of the process. It is not clean water: it goes back into the Chemical Processing Unit through its recycled liquor tank, instead of part of the water (it saves no reagent).
jei.immersivenuclear.fluid_upcoming.info=Fluid of the next machines of the line (chemical separation, effluent treatment and drying). For now it can only be stored in tanks.
