jei.immersivenuclear.chemical_separator.info=5x4x7 multiblock (118 blocks, of them 4 Chemical Engineering Blocks and 8 Radioactive Handling Blocks). Build the structure and hit the redstone engineering block (front side) with the Engineer's Hammer. Inputs: crude and stripping solution on the left end, solvent at the back; outputs: purified solution and effluent on the right end; energy on the heavy engineering blocks. A redstone signal stops the machine (the hammer inverts that).
