desc.immersiveengineering.info.mineral.Fluorite=Fluorite
jei.immersivenuclear.fluorite_ore.info=Found in the Overworld's stone, between layers 10 and 60, in veins of about 8 blocks (fluorite is also a mineral vein of IE's Excavator, with galena and quartz). Breaks into 1-2 Fluorite (more with Fortune); with Silk Touch, the ore goes into IE's Crusher for 3 Fluorite Dust, or into a furnace for 1 Fluorite.
jei.immersivenuclear.fluorite.info=Calcium fluoride, the raw material of hydrofluoric acid. IE's Crusher turns it into Fluorite Dust. Fluorite from other mods (oreFluorite, gemFluorite, dustFluorite) works the same.
jei.immersivenuclear.fluorite_dust.info=Ground fluorite, for the Hydrofluoric Acid Kiln.
item.immersivenuclear.gypsum.name=Gypsum
fluid.immersivenuclear.hydrofluoric_acid=Hydrofluoric Acid
jei.immersivenuclear.gypsum.info=Calcium sulfate, the solid left when fluorite is attacked with sulfuric acid in the Hydrofluoric Acid Kiln. Three uses: in IE's Arc Furnace with coke dust it gives back quicklime and sulfur (for the Sulfuric Acid Unit); in IE's Mixer it takes the clay's place in concrete and the batch gives more; 4 make a Plaster Block.
